SINGLE-SERVER WEB STACK
=======================

Legend
  │ ▼   request path
  ╎ ▲   response path
  ┌─┐   component
  ╔═╗   boundary of the one machine that hosts every service


    ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │                     User                     │
    └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
              │                               ▲
              │ Request over TCP/IP           ╎ Response over TCP/IP
              ▼                               ╎
    ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐                ┌──────────────────┐
    │                www.foobar.com                │──── lookup ───▶│       DNS        │
    │                                              │◀╌╌╌ 8.8.8.8 ╌╌╌│                  │
    └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘                └──────────────────┘
              │                               ▲
              │ A record → 8.8.8.8            ╎ Response
              ▼                               ╎
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  SERVER  (8.8.8.8)                                                 ║
║                                                                    ║
║   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐                 ║
║   │              Web server (Nginx)              │                 ║
║   └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘                 ║
║             │                               ▲                      ║
║             │ HTTP request / reverse proxy  ╎ Response             ║
║             ▼                               ╎                      ║
║   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐                 ║
║   │              Application server              │                 ║
║   └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘                 ║
║             │                               ▲                      ║
║             │ runs                          ╎ Response             ║
║             ▼                               ╎                      ║
║   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐                 ║
║   │               Application code               │                 ║
║   └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘                 ║
║             │                               ▲                      ║
║             │ reads / writes data           ╎ Response             ║
║             ▼                               ╎                      ║
║   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐                 ║
║   │         Database (PotsgreSQL/MySQL)          │                 ║
║   └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘                 ║
║                                                                    ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝


Notes
  - Name resolution happens before the connection is opened. The reply to
    the browser does not travel back through that lookup step.
  - Every component drawn inside the boundary runs on the same machine at
    8.8.8.8, which therefore is a single point of failure.
  - The rendered version of this design is single_server_stack.png.
